<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13384] Auto-generated README.txt contains invalid workingDirectory property name</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13384</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Running ignite when the ignite&apos;s work directory is missing creates the work directory and generates a README.txt inside. &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/blob/864220966caa4157c4fee8a1bc85171623963604/modules/core/src/main/java/org/apache/ignite/internal/util/IgniteUtils.java#L9425&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Currently the README wrongly says&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&quot;You can change the location of working directory with \n&quot; +&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
{{ &quot; igniteConfiguration.&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;setWorkingDirectory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;(location) or \n&quot; +}}&lt;br/&gt;
{{ &quot; &amp;lt;property name=\&quot;&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;workingDirectory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;\&quot; value=\&quot;location\&quot;/&amp;gt; in IgniteConfiguration &amp;lt;bean&amp;gt;.\n&quot;);}}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The &quot;workingDirectory&quot; should be changed to &quot;workDirectory&quot;:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&quot;You can change the location of working directory with \n&quot; +&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
{{ &quot; igniteConfiguration.&lt;font color=&quot;#00875a&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;setWorkDirectory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;(location) or \n&quot; +}}&lt;br/&gt;
{{ &quot; &amp;lt;property name=\&quot;&lt;font color=&quot;#00875a&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;workDirectory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;\&quot; value=\&quot;location\&quot;/&amp;gt; in IgniteConfiguration &amp;lt;bean&amp;gt;.\n&quot;);}}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
